    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f150a2ddb816c34e7ab0e670",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc9369440a9b696bdc605b98c8ab781a251bb4149a0083c969293a17093fbba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb1d5202180ace68cfda1c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能一直一直都在用全力，像风一般奔跑着，\r\n我想比任何人跑得都快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "898321ca5b5f072568b1fc1099e7bda807a925802bb1029d7e41cda591f13904",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4272d208ec1ed489f9254ad0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的双眼闪闪发亮热切注视着――\r\n从中显露出她平时隐藏着的“野兽”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "914bc72d93a184a7ec650085dd3e0ec60681364b29b1ca8a5083cb79fa57e931",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce703c0c91b138fde5d0c34",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么从序盘开始就冲到最前头吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "420c55f2bd456b971af044143a6308451ca6093c371530fd61c72007effd5f26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:081a717abd69c43dbdff657e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当她的愿望实现时，观众席上的人一定都会成为她的俘虏吧。\r\n我不由得想起欢呼声不断的会场的情景。",
      "source_fingerprint": "235f7cd1ecc6b16ff4968ebaec50b8e5f1a63407df713dd0e11e2ee46992f063",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:920aa794c1f120b15581eab3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后就应该着重练习起跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e4215b888a4df9ebbaadd49e56d9f1842fff9c22eea1925bea50c2ff28492d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751c2ebc1628809c492ec566",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc9369440a9b696bdc605b98c8ab781a251bb4149a0083c969293a17093fbba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
