    {
      "uid": "zhcn:666642599cb26989539ca443",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（训练员比刚才更健谈了呢。\r\n看起来很开心、很拼命，总觉得……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "8412a50a49b0f42815077df59be68b28d908098ef310916835f6c6f47212f73a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75bbdab96e6a407180f380a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知不觉聊得太起劲，\r\n回过神来才发现已经过了很长时间了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "646c7f689bf97a708bdadb0df2fa7d43db3c7ae449aec4a757868ee69227c4ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:211628efd26bc65c3c185bb2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知不觉就讲久了，对不起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "87ed7fd1a8ffc5a9636579641bf608661cb8e5b7867dff0a1ae3e1547c3841b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
